# Paseo Phone: written to /etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/phone.conf by run-sshd.sh on every start
# (architecture §5.1). The port comes from run-sshd.sh -p. Key login only, IPv4 only.
AddressFamily inet
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PermitRootLogin prohibit-password
AllowTcpForwarding local
AllowAgentForwarding no
AllowStreamLocalForwarding no
PermitTunnel no
GatewayPorts no
X11Forwarding no
LoginGraceTime 20
MaxStartups 3:50:10
